OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas parking rules could be
OL,4,Amade permanent
OL,5,
OL,6,FA seasonal parking ban in place during
OL,7,Fa York shopping centre's annual Winter
OL,8,FWonderland event could be enforced
OL,9,Fyear-round.
OL,11,FDouble yellow lines would be painted
OL,12,Falong a stretch of Naburn Lane and in
OL,13,FSt Nicholas Avenue leading to the
OL,14,FMcArthur Glen Designer Outlet, with the
OL,15,Fcentre covering the costs.
OL,17,FA City of York Council report
OL,18,Frecommended making the Christmas
OL,19,Frestrictions permanent to help tackle
OL,20,Fparking on verges and footpaths.
